<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>웹 구급일지</title>

<style>

* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif;
    background: #eef2f5;
    color: #222;
    transition: background 0.3s;
}

.container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 30px auto;
    padding: 20px;
}

/* =========================
   헤더
========================= */

.header {
    background: #d71920;
    color: white;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
}

.header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 26px;
}

.header p {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    opacity: 0.9;
}

/* =========================
   카드
========================= */

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

.card h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    border-left: 5px solid #d71920;
    padding-left: 10px;
    font-size: 19px;
}

/* =========================
   Grid
========================= */

.grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 15px;
}

.field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
}

.field.full {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

/* =========================
   입력
========================= */

label {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

input,
select,
textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

textarea {
    min-height: 100px;
    resize: vertical;
}

/* =========================
   사고유형
========================= */

.accident-select {
    font-size: 15px;
}

/* =========================
   GCS
========================= */

.gcs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 15px;
}

.gcs-box {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px;
}

.gcs-box h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 15px;
}

.gcs-result {
    margin-top: 15px;
    padding: 14px;
    background: #f4f4f4;
    border-radius: 7px;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
}

#gcsWarning {
    display: none;
    color: #dc2626;
    background: #fee2e2;
    border: 1px solid #fecaca;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    text-align: center;
}

/* =========================
   중증 모드
========================= */

body.critical-mode {
    animation: criticalFlash 1s infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes criticalFlash {

    from {
        background-color: #eef2f5;
    }

    to {
        background-color: #fee2e2;
    }

}

/* =========================
   활력징후
========================= */

.vital-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
}

.vital-table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 950px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
}

.vital-table th,
.vital-table td {
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: center;
    vertical-align: middle;
}

.vital-table th {
    background: #f4f4f4;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.vital-table td:first-child {
    min-width: 55px;
}

.vital-table td:last-child {
    min-width: 65px;
}

.vital-table input {
    min-width: 70px;
}

.vital-row:nth-child(even) {
    background: #fafafa;
}

.vital-row:focus-within {
    background: #eff6ff;
}

/* =========================
   활력징후 추가 영역
========================= */

.vital-add-area {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 15px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.vital-help {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 13px;
}

/* =========================
   체크박스
========================= */

.check-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 15px;
}

.check-group label {
    font-weight: normal;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    margin: 0;
}

.check-group input[type="checkbox"] {
    width: auto;
}

/* =========================
   버튼
========================= */

.buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

button {
    border: none;
    padding: 13px 22px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
}

.save {
    background: #1976d2;
    color: white;
}

.share {
    background: #16a34a;
    color: white;
}

.print {
    background: #444;
    color: white;
}

.reset {
    background: #eee;
    color: #333;
}

.delete-vital {
    background: #fee2e2;
    color: #b91c1c;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
}

.add-vital {
    background: #1976d2;
    color: white;
    padding: 11px 18px;
}

/* =========================
   작성기록
========================= */

.board-item {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.footer {
    text-align: center;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

/* =========================
   모바일
========================= */

@media (max-width: 700px) {

    .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .gcs-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .container {
        margin: 10px;
        padding: 5px;
    }

    .buttons {
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .buttons button {
        width: 100%;
    }

    .vital-table {
        font-size: 12px;
    }

    .vital-add-area {
        align-items: stretch;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .add-vital {
        width: 100%;
    }

}

/* =========================
   인쇄
========================= */

@media print {

    body {
        background: white;
    }

    .container {
        max-width: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .buttons,
    .vital-add-area,
    .delete-vital {
        display: none !important;
    }

    .card {
        box-shadow: none;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        page-break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .header {
        background: #d71920 !important;
        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        print-color-adjust: exact;
    }

}

</style>
</head>


<body>

<div class="container">

    <!-- =========================
         헤더
    ========================== -->

    <div class="header">

        <h1>🚑 웹 구급일지</h1>

        <p>
            구급활동 기록 및 환자 처치 기록
        </p>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================
         1. 출동 정보
    ========================== -->

    <div class="card">

        <h2>1. 출동 정보</h2>

        <div class="grid">

            <div class="field">

                <label>출동번호</label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="callNumber"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>출동일자</label>

                <input
                    type="date"
                    id="date"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>출동시간</label>

                <input
                    type="time"
                    id="dispatchTime"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>현장 도착시간</label>

                <input
                    type="time"
                    id="arrivalTime"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>현장 출발시간</label>

                <input
                    type="time"
                    id="departureTime"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>귀소시간</label>

                <input
                    type="time"
                    id="returnTime"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field full">

                <label>
                    사고/출동 장소
                </label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="location"
                    placeholder="주소 또는 사고 장소"
                >

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================
         현장정보
    ========================== -->

    <div class="card">

        <h2>현장정보</h2>

        <div class="grid">

            <div class="field">

                <label>도착 일시</label>

                <input
                    type="datetime-local"
                    id="arrivalDateTime"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>사고 장소</label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="accidentLocation"
                    placeholder="사고 장소"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>주증상</label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="mainSymptom"
                    placeholder="환자 증상"
                >

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================
         사고유형
    ========================== -->

    <div class="card">

        <h2>사고유형</h2>

        <select
            id="accidentType"
            class="accident-select"
        >

            <option value="">
                선택하세요
            </option>

            <optgroup label="외상 (Trauma)">

                <option>실족·추락</option>
                <option>낙석</option>
                <option>미끄러짐</option>
                <option>등산스틱/장비 손상</option>
                <option>충돌(나무, 바위 등)</option>
                <option>절단·열상</option>

            </optgroup>


            <optgroup label="질환 (Medical)">

                <option>흉통</option>
                <option>심정지</option>
                <option>호흡곤란</option>
                <option>뇌졸중 의심</option>
                <option>경련</option>
                <option>의식저하</option>
                <option>저혈당</option>
                <option>고혈당</option>

            </optgroup>


            <optgroup label="환경 (Environmental)">

                <option>저체온증</option>
                <option>열탈진</option>
                <option>열사병</option>
                <option>탈수</option>
                <option>번개 손상</option>
                <option>동상</option>

            </optgroup>


            <optgroup label="조난·고립 (Stranded)">

                <option>길 잃음</option>
                <option>야간 고립</option>
                <option>체력 고갈</option>
                <option>장비 부족</option>

            </optgroup>


            <optgroup label="동물·곤충">

                <option>벌 쏘임</option>
                <option>뱀 물림</option>
                <option>야생동물 공격</option>

            </optgroup>

        </select>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================
         GCS
    ========================== -->

    <div class="card">

        <h2>의식평가(GCS)</h2>

        <div class="gcs-grid">


            <div class="gcs-box">

                <h3>👁 눈뜨기 (E)</h3>

                <select id="eye">

                    <option value="4">
                        4 - 자발적으로 눈을 뜬다
                    </option>

                    <option value="3">
                        3 - 말로 지시했을 때 눈을 뜬다
                    </option>

                    <option value="2">
                        2 - 통증 자극에 의해 눈을 뜬다
                    </option>

                    <option value="1">
                        1 - 어떠한 자극에도 눈을 뜨지 못한다
                    </option>

                </select>

            </div>


            <div class="gcs-box">

                <h3>🗣 언어반응 (V)</h3>

                <select id="verbal">

                    <option value="5">
                        5 - 정확한 반응
                    </option>

                    <option value="4">
                        4 - 대화 혼란
                    </option>

                    <option value="3">
                        3 - 언어혼란
                    </option>

                    <option value="2">
                        2 - 이해할 수 없는 소리
                    </option>

                    <option value="1">
                        1 - 반응이 없음
                    </option>

                </select>

            </div>


            <div class="gcs-box">

                <h3>💪 운동반응 (M)</h3>

                <select id="motor">

                    <option value="6">
                        6 - 명령에 따름
                    </option>

                    <option value="5">
                        5 - 통증 자극 국소화
                    </option>

                    <option value="4">
                        4 - 통증 자극 움츠림
                    </option>

                    <option value="3">
                        3 - 이상굴곡
                    </option>

                    <option value="2">
                        2 - 이상신전
                    </option>

                    <option value="1">
                        1 - 전혀 움직이지 않음
                    </option>

                </select>

            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="gcs-result">

            GCS 결과 :

            <span id="gcsResult">
                15점 (정상-Normal)
            </span>

        </div>


        <div id="gcsWarning">

            ⚠️ 중증 환자!
            즉시 기도와 호흡을 확인하십시오.

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================
         2. 환자 정보
    ========================== -->

    <div class="card">

        <h2>2. 환자 정보</h2>

        <div class="grid">


            <div class="field">

                <label>성명</label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="patientName"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>성별</label>

                <select id="gender">

                    <option value="">
                        선택
                    </option>

                    <option>남성</option>
                    <option>여성</option>
                    <option>미상</option>

                </select>

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>나이</label>

                <input
                    type="number"
                    id="age"
                    min="0"
                    max="150"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>생년월일</label>

                <input
                    type="date"
                    id="birthDate"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>보호자</label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="guardian"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>연락처</label>

                <input
                    type="tel"
                    id="phone"
                    placeholder="010-1234-5678"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>환자 분류</label>

                <select id="severity">

                    <option value="">
                        선택
                    </option>

                    <option>응급</option>
                    <option>비응급</option>
                    <option>중증</option>
                    <option>경증</option>

                </select>

            </div>


            <div class="field full">

                <label>거주지</label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="address"
                >

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================
         3. 환자 상태
    ========================== -->

    <div class="card">

        <h2>3. 환자 상태</h2>

        <div class="grid">


            <div class="field">

                <label>의식상태</label>

                <select id="consciousness">

                    <option value="">
                        선택
                    </option>

                    <option>Alert</option>
                    <option>Verbal</option>
                    <option>Pain</option>
                    <option>Unresponsive</option>

                </select>

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>주호소</label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="chiefComplaint"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field">

                <label>발병/사고 시각</label>

                <input
                    type="time"
                    id="onsetTime"
                >

            </div>


            <div class="field full">

                <label>
                    환자 상태 및 증상
                </label>

                <textarea
                    id="symptoms"
                    placeholder="환자의 상태, 증상, 사고 상황 등을 기록하세요."
                ></textarea>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================
         4. 활력징후
    ========================== -->

    <div class="card">

        <h2>4. 활력징후</h2>


        <div class="vital-wrapper">

            <table class="vital-table">

                <thead>

                    <tr>

                        <th>회차</th>
                        <th>측정 시각</th>
                        <th>혈압</th>
                        <th>맥박</th>
                        <th>호흡</th>
                        <th>체온</th>
                        <th>SpO₂</th>
                        <th>혈당</th>
                        <th>삭제</th>

                    </tr>

                </thead>


                <tbody id="vitalBody">


                    <!-- 1차 -->

                    <tr
                        class="vital-row"
                        data-index="1"
                    >

                        <td>
                            <strong>1차</strong>
                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="time"
                                class="vital-time"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="text"
                                class="vital-bp"
                                placeholder="120/80"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-pulse"
                                placeholder="80"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-resp"
                                placeholder="18"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-temp"
                                step="0.1"
                                placeholder="36.5"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-spo2"
                                placeholder="98"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-glucose"
                                placeholder="100"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <button
                                type="button"
                                class="reset delete-vital"
                                disabled
                            >
                                삭제
                            </button>

                        </td>

                    </tr>


                    <!-- 2차 -->

                    <tr
                        class="vital-row"
                        data-index="2"
                    >

                        <td>
                            <strong>2차</strong>
                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="time"
                                class="vital-time"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="text"
                                class="vital-bp"
                                placeholder="120/80"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-pulse"
                                placeholder="80"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-resp"
                                placeholder="18"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-temp"
                                step="0.1"
                                placeholder="36.5"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-spo2"
                                placeholder="98"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <input
                                type="number"
                                class="vital-glucose"
                                placeholder="100"
                            >

                        </td>

                        <td>

                            <button
                                type="button"
                                class="reset delete-vital"
                                disabled
                            >
                                삭제
                            </button>

                        </td>

                    </tr>

                </tbody>

            </table>

        </div>


        <div class="vital-add-area">

            <span class="vital-help">

                ※ 환자 상태 변화에 따라 필요한 만큼
                활력징후를 추가할 수 있습니다.

            </span>


            <button
                type="button"
                class="add-vital"
                onclick="addVitalRow()"
            >

                ＋ 활력징후 추가

            </button>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================
         5. 처치
    ========================== -->

    <div class="card">

        <h2>5. 실시한 처치</h2>


        <div class="check-group">


            <label>

                <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="treatment"
                    value="기도확보"
                >

                기도확보

            </label>


            <label>

                <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="treatment"
                    value="산소투여"
                >

                산소투여

            </label>


            <label>

                <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="treatment"
                    value="심폐소생술"
                >

                심폐소생술

            </label>


            <label>

                <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="treatment"
                    value="AED"
                >

                AED

            </label>


            <label>

                <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="treatment"
                    value="지혈"
                >

                지혈

            </label>


            <label>

                <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="treatment"
                    value="고정"
                >

                부목/고정

            </label>


            <label>

                <input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="treatment"
                    value="환자이송"
                >

                환자이송

            </label>

